[[File:Waitress Adventures.png|thumb|130px|A Waitress in [[Pokémon Adventures]]]]
===Pokémon Adventures===
A Waitress was seen as an onlooker in ''[[PS472|Wheeling and Dealing]]'' as {{adv|White}} was advertising her company, the [[BW Agency]], to people at the {{DL|Nacrene City|Café Warehouse}}.
{{-}}

