==In the TCG==
[[File:WaitressAscendedHeroes215.jpg|200px|thumb|Waitress in the TCG]]
{{main|Waitress (Ascended Heroes 215)}}
'''Waitress''' was introduced as a {{TCG|Supporter card}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] during the English Mega Evolution Series (the Japanese MEGA Series). It was first released in the Japanese {{TCG|Start Deck 100 Battle Collection}} product before debuting in the {{TCG|Ascended Heroes}} expansion, with artwork by [[Cona Nitanda]]. This card allows the player to look at the top 6 cards of their deck and attach a {{TCG|Basic Energy card}} they find there to 1 of their Pokémon.
{{-}}

==Trivia==
* When a {{tc|Maid}} is battled at the {{si|Battle Tower}} and the {{gdis|Battle Frontier|IV}}, she will be shown as a Waitress in {{2v2|Diamond|Pearl}} and as a Maid in {{game|Platinum}}, respectively.
* In [[Pokémon X and Y]], a {{tc|Team Flare Grunt}} disguises herself as a Waitress in [[Lysandre Café]].

